mitre-attack
MITRE ATT&CK mapping discipline and technique reference for opentide threats, 
objectives and detection rules — technique vs sub-technique selection, tactic 
assignment, multi-technique chaining, version pinning, revocation handling, 
coverage gap analysis, platform matrix awareness, and a locally searchable 
technique index. Use when populating threat.att&ck fields in threats, mapping 
objective signals to techniques, tagging detection rules, assessing detection 
coverage against the ATT&CK matrix, or looking up technique IDs and 
descriptions.
